# Architecture lookup

Read `docs/architecture/overview.md` first, then:

- Modules map → `docs/architecture/modules.md`
- Read/write pipelines → `docs/architecture/data-flow.md`
- Workflows crossing layers → `docs/workflows/*.md`

Panels: **Studio** `/studio` (all users), **Admin** `/admin` (`is_admin`). Same Filament resources; admin-only via `canViewAny` / `canAccess`.

Public routes: `routes/web.php` — `{locale}/{username}` group uses `SetLocale`. Inertia skipped for admin/studio/livewire (`HandleInertiaRequests`).
